l items-center select-none text-5xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl items-start\" aria-label=\"StuntWatch — Peta Risiko Stunting Indonesia\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-baseline font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-none text-5xl sm:text-7xl\"><span class=\"text-[#132A4A] dark:text-[#F8FAFC]\">Stun</span><span class=\"relative inline-flex items-center justify-center mx-0.5 h-[52px] w-[36px] sm:h-[68px] sm:w-[46px] translate-y-[3px]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 46 68\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-full w-full overflow-visible\"><path d=\"M18 6C18 3.79086 19.7909 2 22 2H24C26.2091 2 28 3.79086 28 6V52C28 55.866 30.6 58 34.5 58C36.2 58 37.8 57.6 39 57.1V64.5C37.2 65.4 34.4 66 31.5 66C23.2 66 18 61.2 18 52.5V6Z\" class=\"fill-[#132A4A] dark:fill-[#F8FAFC]\"></path><rect x=\"1\" y=\"18\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" rx=\"4\" class=\"fill-[#D9463E] dark:fill-red-400\"></rect><rect x=\"16.5\" y=\"11\" width=\"13\" height=\"29\" rx=\"3.5\" class=\"fill-[#D9463E] dark:fill-red-400\"></rect><path d=\"M4 25.5H13L16 20L19.5 31L23 16.5L26.5 29.5L29.5 23.5L32 25.5H42\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"relative inline-flex items-baseline text-[#159A7C] dark:text-[#2DD4BF]\"><span>Watc</span><span class=\"relative inline-block\">h<svg viewBox=\"0 0 38 18\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -right-7 -top-2 h-5 w-9 sm:-right-9 sm:-top-2.5 sm:h-6 sm:w-11\"><path d=\"M1 10H9L12.5 3L16.5 15.5L20.5 2L24.5 13L27.5 8.5L30 10H36\" class=\"stroke-[#D9463E] dark:stroke-red-400\" stroke-width=\"2.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path><circle cx=\"36\" cy=\"10\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"fill-[#D9463E] dark:fill-red-400\"></circle></svg></span></span></div><p class=\"mt-3 text-base font-bold tracking-wide text-[#132A4A]/85 dark:text-[#F8FAFC]/85 sm:text-xl\">Peta Risiko Stunting Indonesia</p></div></div><p class=\"text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 max-w-[560px] leading-relaxed\">StuntWatch adalah platform pemantauan dan pemetaan risiko stunting interaktif di seluruh 38 provinsi dan 514 kabupaten/kota di Indonesia. Melalui pemodelan indeks risiko terpadu (0–100) dan dekomposisi faktor determinan berbasis SHAP, pembuat kebijakan dapat menelusuri wilayah prioritas dari tingkat nasional hingga intervensi spesifik di tingkat kabupaten/kota.</p><div class=\"flex flex-col items-start gap-2.5 pt-1\"><a class=\"group inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 px-7 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-teal-600 hover:bg-teal-700 dark:bg-[#14b8a6] dark:hover:bg-[#29a195] text-white dark:text-slate-950 font-semibold text-base shadow-md hover:shadow-[0_0_24px_rgba(20,184,166,0.4)] transition-all focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-teal-400\" href=\"/maps\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map w-5 h-5\"><path d=\"M14.106 5.553a2 2 0 0 0 1.788 0l3.659-1.83A1 1 0 0 1 21 4.619v12.764a1 1 0 0 1-.553.894l-4.553 2.277a2 2 0 0 1-1.788 0l-4.212-2.106a2 2 0 0 0-1.788 0l-3.659 1.83A1 1 0 0 1 3 19.381V6.618a1 1 0 0 1 .553-.894l4.553-2.277a2 2 0 0 1 1.788 0z\"></path><path d=\"M15 5.764v15\"></path><path d=\"M9 3.236v15\"></path></svg><span>Maps</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-5 h-5 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 pl-1\">Jelajahi Peta Risiko 38 Provinsi</span></div></div><div class=\"lg:col-span-6 w-full\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl bg-white/95 dark:bg-[#0a0e18]/85 border border-slate-200/90 dark:border-slate-800 p-5 shadow-xl dark:shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-xl overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"mb-3.5 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] font-mono font-semibold tracking-wider text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-globe w-4 h-4 text-teal-600 dark:text-[#4fdbc8]\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h20\"></path></svg><span>INDONESIA SPATIAL SURVEILLANCE LAYER</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400\"><span>CRS: EPSG:4326</span><span>•</span><span class=\"inline-block h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span><span class=\"text-emerald-700 dark:text-[#4edea3] font-semibold\">Live Model</span></div></div><div class=\"relative w-full aspect-[16/10] min-h-[280px] sm:min-h-[320px] bg-slate-50 dark:bg-[#0f131d] rounded-xl border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800/80 overflow-hidden isolate\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full z-0\"><div class=\"flex h-full w-full flex-col items-center justify-center bg-slate-50 dark:bg-[#0f131d]\"><div class=\"h-8 w-8 animate-spin rounded-full border-4 border-muted border-t-teal-500\"></div><p class=\"mt-2.5 text-xs font-mono text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400\">Loading Live Map Data (`/api/map-data`)...</p></div></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-3 left-3 z-[500] pointer-events-none bg-white/95 dark:bg-[#262a35]/90 border border-slate-200/90 dark:border-slate-700/80 backdrop-blur-md rounded-lg px-2.5 py-1.5 flex items-center gap-2 shadow-md\"><span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-red